  "question": {
    "text": "A progressive wave moving along $x$ -axis is represented by $y=A \\sin \\left[\\frac{2 \\pi}{\\lambda}(v t-x)\\right]$ The\r\nwavelength $(\\lambda)$ at which the maximum particle velocity is 3 times the wave velocity is",
